    "name": "For Evelyn II - Shards of Creation",
    "steam_appid": 2248960,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Please note: As the game is  in Early Access, not all of the chapters are complete. You can currently play through the Prologue, and Chapters 1 &amp; 2. Playtime for these combined is around 2-3 hours. The game is planned to have 7 chapters in total, with a playtime of 10-15+ hours, and I will be updating the game continuously to release the chapters as time goes by. Please be patient.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2248960/extras/b45fbbdce727788529e62685844c7a8a.avif?t=1753887964\" data-has-big /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Engage in dynamic combat inspired by PS1 classics.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle enemies with melee, ranged, and magical attacks, or use stealth to outwit them. Every encounter demands strategy as enemies react uniquely. Solve intricate puzzles, discover hidden paths, and defeat powerful bosses to unlock new abilities and artifacts. Whether through force or cunning, carve your path in this unforgiving world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2248960/extras/986fecf32c688660ed47e1a6dc778c68.poster.avif?t=1753887964\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2248960/extras/986fecf32c688660ed47e1a6dc778c68.webm?t=1753887964\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Narrative-Driven RPG: </strong>Immerse yourself in a deep story with complex characters, moral dilemmas, and branching paths.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Choice-Driven Dialogue: </strong>Your dialogue choices affect quests, relationships, and game outcomes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>2D and 3D Fusion: </strong>Explore stunning pixel-art characters in 3D environments, blending retro and modern visuals.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tactical Combat: </strong>Master melee, ranged, stealth, and magic to overcome tough encounters.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Epic Boss Battles: </strong>Challenge powerful bosses guarding legendary treasures.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Crafting and Customization: </strong>Loot materials, craft gear, and enhance magical abilities to adapt to threats.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2248960/extras/f71a941c7fa2514ddfe35e907a79880f.avif?t=1753887964\" data-has-big /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>For Evelyn II - Shards of Creation</strong> continues the story months after the original, as the land of Aura faces war and dark magic. The Watcher Order is Aura\u2019s last hope. As a new Watcher, your choices will shape the conflict\u2019s outcome and the realm\u2019s future. Will you end the bloodshed or let darkness prevail?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2248960/extras/9cd9c3a74c22b47f0da8b97627890827.poster.avif?t=1753887964\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2248960/extras/9cd9c3a74c22b47f0da8b97627890827.webm?t=1753887964\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2248960/extras/f13f18e0408173177a7ad75ded7e554e.avif?t=1753887964\" data-has-big /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Embark on a journey in For Evelyn II</strong> and meet compelling characters with their own desires and secrets. Forge bonds, negotiate with factions, and face enemies who challenge your ideals. Uncover hidden motives, build alliances, and alter destinies through your choices.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2248960/extras/fd770945bae8b5bc5789aaa5b7aeb1a2.poster.avif?t=1753887964\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2248960/extras/fd770945bae8b5bc5789aaa5b7aeb1a2.webm?t=1753887964\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2248960/extras/51766d47525b5c2998aca032d9c7980e.avif?t=1753887964\" data-has-big /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>For Evelyn II features a captivating blend of 2D and 3D art.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pixel characters and richly detailed environments create a nostalgic yet fresh world. Animated sprites and character bust art bring life to every interaction, while diverse locations beg to be explored.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2248960/extras/7dd1988e3745e59815bb5fc1d1167903.poster.avif?t=1753887964\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2248960/extras/7dd1988e3745e59815bb5fc1d1167903.webm?t=1753887964\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2248960/extras/43e8ea33b7e1aadda1d17f0a3fb7e0a9.avif?t=1753887964\" data-has-big /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create your own character and see them integrated into the world as an NPC. With over 100 player-inspired characters already, you can contribute to the ever-evolving, immersive experience of Aura\u2019s inhabitants.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2248960/extras/a927b79c42a5acb993c5cc95ebe92a29.poster.avif?t=1753887964\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2248960/extras/a927b79c42a5acb993c5cc95ebe92a29.webm?t=1753887964\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Please note: As the game is  in Early Access, not all of the chapters are complete. You can currently play through the Prologue, and Chapters 1 &amp; 2. Playtime for these combined is around 2-3 hours. The game is planned to have 7 chapters in total, with a playtime of 10-15+ hours, and I will be updating the game continuously to release the chapters as time goes by. Please be patient.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2248960/extras/b45fbbdce727788529e62685844c7a8a.avif?t=1753887964\" data-has-big /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Engage in dynamic combat inspired by PS1 classics.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle enemies with melee, ranged, and magical attacks, or use stealth to outwit them. Every encounter demands strategy as enemies react uniquely. Solve intricate puzzles, discover hidden paths, and defeat powerful bosses to unlock new abilities and artifacts. Whether through force or cunning, carve your path in this unforgiving world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2248960/extras/986fecf32c688660ed47e1a6dc778c68.poster.avif?t=1753887964\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2248960/extras/986fecf32c688660ed47e1a6dc778c68.webm?t=1753887964\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Narrative-Driven RPG: </strong>Immerse yourself in a deep story with complex characters, moral dilemmas, and branching paths.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Choice-Driven Dialogue: </strong>Your dialogue choices affect quests, relationships, and game outcomes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>2D and 3D Fusion: </strong>Explore stunning pixel-art characters in 3D environments, blending retro and modern visuals.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tactical Combat: </strong>Master melee, ranged, stealth, and magic to overcome tough encounters.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Epic Boss Battles: </strong>Challenge powerful bosses guarding legendary treasures.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Crafting and Customization: </strong>Loot materials, craft gear, and enhance magical abilities to adapt to threats.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2248960/extras/f71a941c7fa2514ddfe35e907a79880f.avif?t=1753887964\" data-has-big /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>For Evelyn II - Shards of Creation</strong> continues the story months after the original, as the land of Aura faces war and dark magic. The Watcher Order is Aura\u2019s last hope. As a new Watcher, your choices will shape the conflict\u2019s outcome and the realm\u2019s future. Will you end the bloodshed or let darkness prevail?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2248960/extras/9cd9c3a74c22b47f0da8b97627890827.poster.avif?t=1753887964\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2248960/extras/9cd9c3a74c22b47f0da8b97627890827.webm?t=1753887964\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2248960/extras/f13f18e0408173177a7ad75ded7e554e.avif?t=1753887964\" data-has-big /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Embark on a journey in For Evelyn II</strong> and meet compelling characters with their own desires and secrets. Forge bonds, negotiate with factions, and face enemies who challenge your ideals. Uncover hidden motives, build alliances, and alter destinies through your choices.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2248960/extras/fd770945bae8b5bc5789aaa5b7aeb1a2.poster.avif?t=1753887964\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2248960/extras/fd770945bae8b5bc5789aaa5b7aeb1a2.webm?t=1753887964\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2248960/extras/51766d47525b5c2998aca032d9c7980e.avif?t=1753887964\" data-has-big /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>For Evelyn II features a captivating blend of 2D and 3D art.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pixel characters and richly detailed environments create a nostalgic yet fresh world. Animated sprites and character bust art bring life to every interaction, while diverse locations beg to be explored.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2248960/extras/7dd1988e3745e59815bb5fc1d1167903.poster.avif?t=1753887964\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2248960/extras/7dd1988e3745e59815bb5fc1d1167903.webm?t=1753887964\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2248960/extras/43e8ea33b7e1aadda1d17f0a3fb7e0a9.avif?t=1753887964\" data-has-big /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create your own character and see them integrated into the world as an NPC. With over 100 player-inspired characters already, you can contribute to the ever-evolving, immersive experience of Aura\u2019s inhabitants.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2248960/extras/a927b79c42a5acb993c5cc95ebe92a29.poster.avif?t=1753887964\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2248960/extras/a927b79c42a5acb993c5cc95ebe92a29.webm?t=1753887964\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p>",
